  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">Official distributor of STEICO natural wood fiber underlayment. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">Feel welcomed to contact us for any questions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\"><strong>STEICO natural acoustic Wood Fiber Underlayment</strong>☀️, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">a soundproofing, high-compression strength, and leveling product for floating and nail-down LVT, vinyl, laminate, engineered, and wood floors. Boards are made from 100% natural pine wood fiber, free from chemicals, VOCs, and glue. </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">🌲 <strong>STEICO&rsquo;s High-Performance Sound Control</strong> enhances room comfort with superior acoustic properties. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">🌲 <strong>Certified for Best Soundproofing: </strong>STEICO wood fiber passes the strictest acoustic tests (6&rdquo; concrete slab without ceiling assembly) and meets the highest US standards for effective noise reduction. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">🌲 <strong>100% Natural &amp; Eco-Friendly:</strong> Made from renewable resources, this soundproof padding contains no harmful emissions, VOCs, or adhesives. It&rsquo;s fully recyclable, improving safety and increasing property value. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">🌲 <strong>Durable &amp; Squeak-Free: </strong>With high compression strength and \"Click-Lock Protection,\" STEICO ensures a sturdy floor that resists squeaks and prevents the \"springy\" effect (movement) when walking. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,;\">🌲 <strong>Vapor-Open Technology: </strong>This feature helps prevent conditions for mold growth under the floor by allowing air circulation while regulating the microclimate for added comfort.</span></p>",
